NOTE ON THE DATA IN vocab/

The MIT licence above covers the code. The curated data files have their own
provenance and are not all the author's to relicense:

  conductors.json, ensembles.json, coltrane_mb_cache.json,
  coltrane_mb_sessions.json
      Derived from MusicBrainz, whose core data is released under CC0.
      https://musicbrainz.org/doc/About/Data_License

  coltrane_wild_sessions.json
      Session facts (dates, personnel, locations, tune listings) mined from
      the web edition of David Wild, "The Recordings of John Coltrane: A
      Discography", 2nd ed., Wildmusic 1979, at wildmusic-jazz.com.
      Individual facts are not copyrightable, but the compilation is Wild's
      work. This extract is kept for personal cataloguing of a private
      collection. If you redistribute it, credit Wild; if you are doing
      anything commercial with it, seek permission.

  coltrane_sessions.json, coltrane_personnel.json
      Hand-written by the author from general knowledge, then reconciled
      against the sources above. Confidence and source fields on each entry
      record how far any given value has been verified.

No audio is included, referenced by content, or redistributed here.
